# A condition that is not a pattern: not a presence test, an equality or a type test.
-- source.cue --
n: int32
-- target.cue --
big?: bool
-- lens.cue --
input: _
result: {if input.n > 5 {big: true}}
-- out --
unknown
result has fields under input.n > 5, which is not a pattern: a presence test (p != _|_), an equality (p == c) or a type test ((p & T) != _|_) on an input field, or a conjunction (&&) of these (rule unknown-pattern) @ lens.cue:2:10
